  "3785ab3a-d7e4-4d40-8c92-3f0b634291a9"],
 "\[LineSeparator]makes a 1D HammingKernel for filtering k-space. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"c3ecc9e4-6d1e-d142-aef9-9fd268afb39d"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["MakeHammingFilter",
